url: "https://github.com/jbghia/great-pyramid-solar-noon"
abstract: >-
  Research code and archived outputs for computing the dates on which the
  Sun's airless meridian altitude at Giza equals adopted inclinations of the
  Great Pyramid's southern shafts (JPL DE422 via Skyfield), the resulting
  midnight stellar comparisons with the Hipparcos catalogue, and a PyEphem
  inclination-sensitivity test for the Queen's Chamber shaft.
keywords:
  - archaeoastronomy
  - Great Pyramid
  - solar noon
  - ephemeris
  - Skyfield
  - Hipparcos
